<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns two secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns two secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 4.904 billion pesos in the secondary market on Monday through four credit auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The first two credits had already been assigned at 1235 local time.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT	    TERM	WEIGHTED AVE</p>
<p>    1.301 bln pesos 15 days   25.63 pct</p>
<p>    1.301 bln pesos 14 days   25.60 pct</p>
<p>    1.302 bln pesos  9 days</p>
<p>    1.000 bln pesos  1 day</p>
<p>-- Patricia Lezama, Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
